%e A400778 T(2,2) = 4: the 2 X 2 grid has 4 places for a mirror. With no mirror the curve is 2 closed paths. A mirror in exactly one place joins them into one path, and there are 4 ways to choose that place. Two or more mirrors always give 2 or more paths.
